{"seq":1,"slug":"retraining-baseline","title":"重训基线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-unlearning/exact/retraining-baseline","wordCount":1560,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"重训基线\">重训基线</h1><p>如果有人问「怎样才能 100% 确定模型忘掉了某条数据」，唯一无可辩驳的答案是：把那条数据从训练集里拿掉，从头再训一个模型。这个朴素到近乎废话的方法——重训（retraining from scratch）——恰恰是整个机器遗忘领域的阿基米德支点。它本身不解决任何效率问题，但它定义了「正确答案」，让所有更聪明的方法有了可对照的真值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本篇反复用到几个词，先把它们定清楚。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>重训（retraining from scratch）</strong>：把要删的数据从训练集拿掉后从头再训一个模型，即把遗忘算法直接定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">U</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{U} := \\mathcal{A}(D_r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0993em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。它按定义就满足精确遗忘。</li>\n<li><strong>金标准 / 真值参照</strong>：重训不是去逼近重训分布，它<strong>就是</strong>重训分布，因此成为衡量所有近似方法「到底离真遗忘有多远」的基准模型。</li>\n<li><strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{O}(nC)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 成本</strong>：设单次训练计算量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，朴素地为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个删除请求各重训一次，总开销就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 倍。机器遗忘的整部历史可读作「如何把这个量级压下来」。</li>\n<li><strong>留一法（leave-one-out）</strong>：比较「在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 上训练」与「在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>∖</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D \\setminus \\{z\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 上训练」两个模型的差异，用来刻画样本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 的全部影响；它是影响函数族的理论出发点。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>有了这套词汇，就能看清重训为何既是定义、又是真值、还是近似方法的理论锚点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么重训是金标准\">为什么重训是金标准</h2><p>回到 <a href=\"../foundations/unlearning-definitions\">遗忘的定义</a>：精确遗忘要求遗忘后模型分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{U}(w, D_f, D_r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0993em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 等于重训分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{A}(D_r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。重训方法把遗忘算法直接定义成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">U</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{U} := \\mathcal{A}(D_r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0993em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——它不是去逼近重训分布，它<strong>就是</strong>重训分布。等式两边按定义完全相等，精确性不证自明。</p>\n<p>这种「定义即正确」的地位带来两个角色。其一是<strong>保证提供者</strong>：任何对遗忘保证有硬要求的场景（强合规、审计），重训是兜底选项。其二更重要——它是<strong>评测的真值</strong>。当你想知道一个近似方法到底有多接近「真遗忘」，你需要一个参照模型；这个参照几乎总是重训出来的模型。后面 <a href=\"../practice/unlearning-evaluation\">遗忘评测</a> 里大量指标（比如遗忘集上的损失分布是否与重训模型一致）都建立在「拿重训模型当基准」之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本-为什么不能总是重训\">成本：为什么不能总是重训</h2><p>重训的问题只有一个，但足够致命：贵。下表把代价拆开看，对比量级随模型规模急剧恶化。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>小模型（如 ResNet/CIFAR）</th>\n<th>大语言模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单次训练时长</td>\n<td>分钟到小时</td>\n<td>数天到数周</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单次训练成本</td>\n<td>可忽略</td>\n<td>数十万到数百万美元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除请求频率</td>\n<td>偶发</td>\n<td>持续涌入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据可复现性</td>\n<td>通常完整保留</td>\n<td>预训练语料常已不可完整复现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每请求重训可行性</td>\n<td>勉强可行</td>\n<td>完全不可行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>成本随请求数线性叠加是关键痛点。若每个删除请求都触发一次全量重训，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个请求就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次完整训练。设单次训练计算量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，朴素重训应对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个独立请求的总开销是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{O}(nC)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。对大模型，单个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 已不可承受，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 更是天方夜谭。机器遗忘的整部历史，可以读作「如何把这个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{O}(nC)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 压下来」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重训成本的拆解\">重训成本的拆解</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[一个删除请求触发重训] --&gt; B[准备 D_r]&#10;    B --&gt; C[完整前向反向&lt;br/&gt;所有 epoch]&#10;    C --&gt; D[超参搜索可能重来]&#10;    D --&gt; E[验证与对齐流程重跑]&#10;    E --&gt; F[单请求总成本 = C]&#10;    F --&gt; G{n 个请求}&#10;    G --&gt;|朴素串行| H[总成本 n×C 不可行]&#10;    G --&gt;|攒批延迟处理| I[总成本 ≈ C 但牺牲时效]&#10;    G --&gt;|架构改造| J[转向分片 SISA]\">flowchart TD\n    A[一个删除请求触发重训] --&gt; B[准备 D_r]\n    B --&gt; C[完整前向反向&lt;br/&gt;所有 epoch]\n    C --&gt; D[超参搜索可能重来]\n    D --&gt; E[验证与对齐流程重跑]\n    E --&gt; F[单请求总成本 = C]\n    F --&gt; G{n 个请求}\n    G --&gt;|朴素串行| H[总成本 n×C 不可行]\n    G --&gt;|攒批延迟处理| I[总成本 ≈ C 但牺牲时效]\n    G --&gt;|架构改造| J[转向分片 SISA]</pre><p>上图揭示了两条把成本拉回可控的朴素思路，它们不改方法只改调度。第一条是<strong>批处理</strong>：不逐个请求重训，而是攒够一批删除请求后只重训一次。这把总成本从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">nC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 压回接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，代价是时效——一个请求可能要等数周才被真正执行，这在 GDPR「无不当延迟」的要求下是有风险的，相关合规张力见 <a href=\"../practice/unlearning-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>。第二条思路是<strong>架构改造</strong>：在训练之初就把数据组织成便于局部重训的结构，使得删一条数据只需重训一小部分——这正是 <a href=\"sharded-sisa\">分片 SISA</a> 的核心洞见，也是本章下一篇的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"留一法视角与影响的连续性\">留一法视角与影响的连续性</h2><p>重训还提供了一个理解遗忘的理论视角：留一法（leave-one-out）。比较「在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 上训练」与「在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>∖</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D \\setminus \\{z\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 上训练」两个模型的差异，恰好刻画了样本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 对模型的全部影响。把这个差异在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 处做一阶展开，得到的就是影响函数——它是 <a href=\"../approximate/influence-based\">基于影响函数</a> 一整族近似方法的出发点。换句话说，影响函数方法本质上是在「不真的重训」的前提下，用泰勒展开预测「如果重训会发生什么」。重训是它要逼近的目标，也是检验它逼近得准不准的标尺。</p>\n<p>这条线索说明重训基线远不只是一个笨办法。它是定义、是真值、也是近似方法的理论锚点。理解了重训贵在哪里、它精确在哪里，你才真正理解后面每一种方法在省什么、赌什么。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>重训从头把遗忘算法定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">U</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{U} := \\mathcal{A}(D_r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0993em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，按定义满足精确遗忘，无需证明。</li>\n<li>它的双重角色：强合规场景的兜底保证、以及几乎所有遗忘评测的真值参照。</li>\n<li>唯一缺陷是成本：大模型单次训练已不可承受，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个请求朴素串行是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{O}(nC)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>不改方法的两条降本思路是批处理（攒批重训，牺牲时效）和架构改造（转向 SISA）。</li>\n<li>留一法把重训与影响函数连起来：影响函数方法本质是在不重训的前提下预测重训的结果。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"sharded-sisa\">分片 SISA</a> 用架构把重训成本从全量降到分片；<a href=\"exact-guarantees\">精确遗忘保证</a> 审视重训「精确」背后的隐含前提。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：联邦场景下的精确遗忘需重训子流程，见 <a href=\"../../federated-privacy-ml/foundations/fedavg\">FedAvg</a>；重训涉及的对齐流程重跑成本见 <a href=\"../../rlhf-preference-alignment/reward-modeling/rlhf-ppo\">RLHF 与 PPO</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"重训基线","id":"重训基线"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么重训是金标准","id":"为什么重训是金标准"},{"level":2,"text":"成本：为什么不能总是重训","id":"成本-为什么不能总是重训"},{"level":2,"text":"重训成本的拆解","id":"重训成本的拆解"},{"level":2,"text":"留一法视角与影响的连续性","id":"留一法视角与影响的连续性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"遗忘谱系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-unlearning/foundations/unlearning-taxonomy"},"next":{"title":"分片 SISA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-unlearning/exact/sharded-sisa"}}